=begin pod
=TITLE CarolynDB v11 Manual

=head1 Unicode & Fonts

CarolynDB is Unicode-first. All interfaces use UTF-8.

=head2 Environment

=item * CAROLYNDB_UNICODE=1 - enforce UTF-8 everywhere

=item * CAROLYNDB_FONT=noto - prefer Noto font stack

=item * CAROLYNDB_FONT_URL - optional webfont CSS URL

=item * CAROLYNDB_CSV_BOM=1 - prepend UTF-8 BOM for CSV export (Excel)

=head1 INSTALLATION

  unzip CarolynDB-v11.zip
  cd CarolynDB_v11
  zef install --deps-only .

=end pod
